y:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">点</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">）、</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">参评论文电子稿</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">、参评论文</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇目汇总表（附件</span>1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">、</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">《绍兴市</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">直</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教育教学论文评审承诺书》</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">电子稿（附件</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">）、</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">《绍兴市</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">直</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教育教学论文评审承诺书》</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">纸质稿</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">份</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，于</span>4<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">0</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日前</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">交至教科室。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">2<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．每校每个学科（项目）教育教学论文报送数</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">～</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">3<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．论文要突出主题、言之有据、语言简洁、表述规范，字数不超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6000</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">字。以课题报告、调研报告形式撰写的，不予评奖。已在市</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">直</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">级及以上报刊公开发表或各类征文竞赛中获奖的论文不再参评。参评论文需要提交纸质稿一式</span>4<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份（</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">word</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">文档</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">A4</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">纸打印，左上角注明参评论文的类别，其中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份注明单位、姓名、联系电话等信息，其余</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份不署名），正文中不得出现作者姓名、单位、联系电话等信息。参评论文作者署名不得多于</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人。同一作者两个类别的论文最多各报送</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇，同一篇论文只能参加一个类别的评审。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">4<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">评审承诺。凡参加教育教学论文评审的作者，须填写《绍兴市</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">直</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教育教学论文评审承诺书》（附件</span>2<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">），承诺其教育教学论文的原创性、真实性，同意在市研究院网站上公开论文，并经由所在单位签署意见，加盖公章。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">若发现诚信缺失等问题，对责任人进行通报，并在三年内不予参加绍兴市直级及以上相关教学评审活动。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">二、教学活动评审</span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教学活动</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">评审</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">旨在以评审为载体，开展立足课程标准的学科品质课堂的实践与探索，关注</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">品质课堂</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的七个要素，充分体现资源与技术在学科课堂教学中的融入与运用。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．评审原则</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">突显</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">倡导教育理念、突出具体专题、结合教学问题、融入研究视角、体现公平公正</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的基本原则。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">2<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．评审时间</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">市直教学活动评审在</span>4<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">～</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月份举行。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">请各学科教研组长</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">于</span>4<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日前参评名单</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">电子稿</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（附件</span>3</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">报送</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">至教科室</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，同时将学科参评教师名单告知相关学科教研员</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">3<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．参评对象</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">高中各学科：语文、数学、英语、物理、化学、生物、思想政治、历史、地理、体育与健康、通用技术、信息技术、综合实践、心理健康、生涯规划。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">推荐数：各校每科限报</span>1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人，允许缺报。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">4<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．评审形式</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">评审一般采用现场教学活动的形式，具体程序为：在活动开始</span>3~5<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">天前公布教学内容；参评教师评审日一早进行抽签，然后按抽签顺序进行教学活动。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">5<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．取奖上限</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">奖级设一、二等奖，参评教师不多于</span>6<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人时，按照</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1∶1</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">取奖；多于</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人时，一等奖上限为</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">节，其余为二等奖。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">附件：</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px">1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．绍兴市直教育教学论文评审选送篇目汇总表</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">        </span></span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_xls.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/3/202403191702455205.xls" title="202403191702455205.xls" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">202403191702455205.xls</a></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"> <span style="text-indent: 107px; font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 21px;">2<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．绍兴市</span></span><span style="text-indent: 107px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 21px;">直</span><span style="text-indent: 107px; font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教育教学论文评审承诺书</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style="text-indent: 107px; font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312"></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 16px;">                    <img style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" /><a style="font-size:12px; color:#0066cc;" href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/3/202403191703166592.doc" title="202403191703166592.doc">202403191703166592.doc</a></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"> <span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: 0px; text-indent: 107px;">3</span><span style="font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: 0px; text-indent: 107px; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;">．绍兴市直教学活动评审选送汇总表</span></p><p style="line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">                  </span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2024/3/202403191706031323.doc" title="202403191706031323.doc" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">202403191706031323.doc</a></p><p style="line-height: 40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"></span>
</p><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px"> </span></p><p>
</p>
    
